Advanced machine, winding and construction study (@pe-machine-study: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @electrical-power-engineering, #source "../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH", #source "../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30", #source "../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP", #electrical-power-engineering "../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3") { r_29CHQQNJK1KSCHC5910B7CKD4G
**Read:** [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH), entire graduate programme and substantial design problems; [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30), entire selected design manual; [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP), both entire studies and authorized full good-practice guide.

Complete all of [Electric Machines — MIT 6.685, Fall 2013](../sources/Electric-Machines-MIT-6-685.lingua#r_6A4HM4XV13NAZDRV92PZDJ31XH) and the whole [Hydrogenerator Design Manual — Bureau of Reclamation](../sources/Hydrogenerator-Design-Manual-USBR.lingua#r_4ENJR7JW17MTFV4J47G989AN30) design manual for a selected rotating-machine case. Choose a bounded design or uprating question with enough public information to reconstruct geometry, winding, material and duty. State what is measured, assumed and unknown before optimizing dimensions.

Derive flux, winding factors/harmonics, induced voltage, torque, leakage and losses, then compare a reduced magnetic model with independent field or published test evidence. Include saturation, temperature, cooling, mechanical clearances/support and insulation. Produce an actual winding/connection plan and the calculations needed to explain its construction, rather than only a block model.

Investigate manufacturing tolerance, a material change or a rewinding choice using the complete [Motor rewind studies and good practice — EASA/AEMT](../sources/Motor-Rewind-Study-and-Good-Practice-EASA-AEMT.lingua#r_3K38XSH8DWC79G20NF55ATKEJP) methods/studies. Compare the resulting resistance, loss, waveform and thermal predictions with an independent observable. Suitable supervised fabrication/testing can demonstrate physical capability; a complete documented design reconstruction must be labelled accordingly. The finished work should let another specialist trace a functional requirement through calculations, drawings, material state, assembly assumptions and evidence, and identify which unresolved mechanical/thermal issues require the connected full subjects.

**Continue:** [An integrated electrical-power-system investigation](../study/An-integrated-electrical-power-system-investigation.lingua#r_06BN864FF9C0AN3EWZJE78Y6Y3).

**Return:** [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](../Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).
